            <ArticleTitle>Chitosan-Gated Magnetic-Responsive Nanocarrier for Dual-Modal Optical Imaging, Switchable Drug Release, and Synergistic Therapy.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1002/adhm.201601080</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A dual-layer shell hollow nanostructure as drug carrier that provides instant on/off function for drug release and contrast enhancement for multimodal imaging is reported. The on-demand drug release is triggered by irradiation of an external magnetic field. The nanocarrier also demonstrates a high drug loading capacity and synergistic magnetic-thermal and chemotherapy.</AbstractText>
